# text = You shall go there one day , and find them blundering through half the nautical terms in Young's Dictionary , apropos of the " Nancy " having run down the " Sarah Jane ", or Mr . Peggotty and the Yarmouth boatmen having put off in a gale of wind with an anchor and cable to the " Nelson " Indiaman in distress ; and you shall go there another day , and find them deep in the evidence , pro and con , respecting a clergyman who has misbehaved himself ; and you shall find the judge in the nautical case , the advocate in the clergyman's case , or contrariwise .
