# text = They are like actors : now a man's a judge , and now he is not a judge ; now he's one thing , now he's another ; now he's something else , change and change about ; but it's always a very pleasant , profitable little affair of private theatricals , presented to an uncommonly select audience But advocates and proctors are not one and the same Are they No the advocates are civilians - men who have taken a doctor's degree at college - which is the first reason of my knowing anything about it .
