# text = You need not call me Little , you need not call me by the name I have disgraced ; but oh , listen to my agony , and have mercy on me so far as to write me some word of uncle , never , never to be seen in this world by my eyes again ! ' Dear , if your heart is hard towards me - justly hard , I know - but , listen , if it is hard , dear , ask him I have wronged the most - him whose wife I was to have been - before you quite decide against my poor poor prayer !
