# text = If he should be so compassionate as to say that you might write something for me to read - I think he would , oh , I think he would , if you would only ask him , for he always was so brave and so forgiving - tell him then ( but not else ), that when I hear the wind blowing at night , I feel as if it was passing angrily from seeing him and uncle , and was going up to God against me .
