# text = To have died , would not have been much - what can I say ? - I would have lived I would have lived to be old , in the wretched streets - and to wander about , avoided , in the dark - and to see the day break on the ghastly line of houses , and remember how the same sun used to shine into my room , and wake me once - I would have done even that , to save her What shall I ever do How can I go on as I am , a solitary curse to myself , a living disgrace to everyone I come near Stamp upon me , kill me !
