# text = I have myself directed some attention , during the past week , to the art of baking ; and my son Wilkins has issued forth with a walking-stick and driven cattle , when permitted , by the rugged hirelings who had them in charge , to render any voluntary service in that direction - which I regret to say , for the credit of our nature , was not often ; he being generally warned , with imprecations , to desist All very right indeed Mrs .
