# text = Do you know , what I have heard tonight , Agnes You knew I had no mother and felt kindly towards me More than that , Agnes , I knew , almost as if I had known this story , that there was something inexplicably gentle and softened , surrounding you ; something that might have been sorrowful in someone else ( as I can now understand it was ), but was not so in you Will you laugh at my cherishing such fancies , Agnes No Or at my saying that I really believe I felt , even then , that you could be faithfully affectionate against all discouragement , and never cease to be so , until you ceased to live ? - Will you laugh at such a dream Oh , no !
