# text = If not today , why then tomorrow And Emily 'Em'ly arter you left her , ma'am - and I never heerd her saying of her prayers at night , t'other side the canvas screen , when we was settled in the Bush , but what I heerd your name - and arter she and me lost sight of Mas'r Davy , that theer shining sundown - was that low , at first , that , if she had know'd then what Mas'r Davy kep from us so kind and thowtful , 'tis my opinion she'd have drooped away .
