# text = The remaining toasts were DOCTOR MELL ; Mrs . MICAWBER ( who gracefully bowed her acknowledgements from the side-door , where a galaxy of beauty was elevated on chairs , at once to witness and adorn the gratifying scene ), Mrs . RIDGER BEGS ( late Miss Micawber ); Mrs . MELL ; WILKINS MICAWBER , ESQUIRE , JUNIOR ( who convulsed the assembly by humorously remarking that he found himself unable to return thanks in a speech , but would do so , with their permission , in a song ); Mrs . MICAWBER'S FAMILY ( well known , it is needless to remark , in the mother-country ), & amp ; c . & amp ; c . & amp ; c .
